Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：真月的真身是贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我被那家伙骗了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把大家带到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个危险的沙尔加索。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且真月作为友情证明给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那5张V卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然是逼我入绝境的陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我卡组里剩下的卡只有3张。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.53,0:00:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去…＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)你就尽量挣扎给我看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正不管怎样，你们所有人都别想活着离开这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这全都是游马你自作自受的结果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是这种束手无策的样子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为我报仇会替我报仇的吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶——！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)真月居然是巴利安的人……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)游马明明知道这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.41,0:00:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却连我们也瞒着吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)为什么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，游马和星光体就……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，按照约定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你尝尝「沙尔加索」的效果吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)身心都变得破烂不堪了是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再伤得更狠一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被贝库塔精心准备的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和心理战{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彻底玩弄于股掌之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.89,0:01:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，都是我的错。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也太疏忽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然要把巴利安的卡作为战力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相应的风险就该好好深思熟虑才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就直说吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是我把真月的事说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不会变成这样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，确实！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对搭档阿斯特拉尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有所隐瞒确实是不应该啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.27,0:02:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）那家伙居然利用别人的软肋！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）真是下作的战斗方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.51,0:02:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）比起搭档{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你选择了和我的友情，你这个叛徒！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为你说要保护阿斯特拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～啊，找借口了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不行 再这样下去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只会被贝库塔的节奏越卷越深。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份说不清的不安是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这简直就像黑暗的碎片诞生了一般……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.63,0:02:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 这是…… 到底……》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在发什么呆！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光荣的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.27,0:02:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤墓地里的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来吧 No.104
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}假面魔导士 闪耀！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要 用这张卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊明明连霍普雷V都召唤出来了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果还是白费功夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连自己 No.的复活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都算进去了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去霍普雷V要被破坏掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既不能攻击也无法发动效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是说那个木偶状态的霍普雷V吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要那家伙还在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过萨尔加索的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就要承受500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会好好享受的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动闪耀的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀1回合只能一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从对方的卡组中选1张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 使用这个效果的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.21,0:04:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀不能攻击哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你的卡组就只剩2张了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.71,0:04:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗输了的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就会沉入这个萨尔加索。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不止这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你一起来的同伴 会怎么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)难道 我们也要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.43,0:04:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永远留在这个萨尔加索！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)那种事我才不要喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早知道就不来了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.74,0:06:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊 那副不甘心的表情！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你们这些无聊的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}假装同伴{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也算没白费。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖下一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多鲁贝）上了，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动荣耀先驱的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.19,0:06:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方1只怪兽的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且将其攻击力减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！荣耀先驱！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪电爆裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（米扎艾尔）上！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击银河！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}歼灭的时空螺旋！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（奥比塔尔7）快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！？快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）真可怜啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就因为跟着游马那些家伙也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 鲨鱼复仇溅射 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在 鲨鱼深潜者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降1000点复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 鲨鱼深潜者！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.09,0:07:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将鲨鱼深潜者的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力数值的伤害给予对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 召唤了怪兽超量怪兽的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就接下沙尔加索的效果吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙是 舍肉断骨{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在采取极其冒险的战法。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 海咬龙鲨龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材 混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自暗黑深渊中觉醒的最强之牙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙鲨龙·须！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了… 又因为萨尔加索的效果…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就行了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)鲨龙·须在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:08:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己生命值在1000以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙利用了萨尔加索的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己削减生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降到了900。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟、竟然计算到了这种地步…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}削减生命来特殊召唤 漂亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对于你这样的男人我认识。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多贝）你让我想起了那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.09,0:09:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你那狂野的言行背后我感受到了率直的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我本想与你 不是以这种形式{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是以正正当当的决斗来一较高下。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦话等睡着了再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三角魔狼。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只等级5以上的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为3个超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级8的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙3体份{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤 要来了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海斗）用3体份的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汹涌的银河啊 现在正是化作怒涛之光{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身之时！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧！ 我的灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼·光子·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是沙拉曼蛇的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 由于三角·狼的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}舞台已经准备好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 中微子·俯冲。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方场上 有怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的 银河眼的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材取除一个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组 将升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障·之力送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动那个效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人之力是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让超量怪兽升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的回合进行升阶！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（米扎艾尔）我用阶级８的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贯穿汹涌的银河{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从时间诞生之前 苏醒吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越永恒之龙的星辰！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.42,0:11:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显现吧 CNo.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（米扎艾尔）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 那家伙的 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时 未能一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就结束了的 ２只银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它们如今 在此…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 正是现在一决雌雄的时候到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？呜啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们看，飞艇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞艇被吸进去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:12:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？那个漩涡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞艇……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）啊啊，那个啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偶尔会有的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}萨尔加索各处会出现的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被吸进黑洞里去啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定是这个萨尔加索
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在渴求祭品呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）不行～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）住手呜啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大、大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）得逃才行……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，不逃不行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.97,0:13:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.57,0:13:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)要我帮你们把那个洞堵上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我持有的『太阳球』灯塔的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果 暂时增幅一下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定就能救那些家伙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.07,0:13:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 可不能白干。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你手上的 No.卡全部交出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要我把 No.卡全部交出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能做得到吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是那么做了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的搭档星光
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可就要出大事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那飞船上那些朋友就放弃咯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.87,0:14:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的对手是我和星光吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟们跟这事没关系吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那些没关系的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一路牵扯到这里来的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是要Astral还是要朋友{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}二选一。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去小鸟她们就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.87,0:14:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家会有危险的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral对朋友还真是冷漠啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我根本没法选什么Astral还是小鸟们。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能选得出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.53,0:15:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这也是贝库塔的作战！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是想救重要的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是想救大家而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.39,0:15:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线电]（贝库塔）嗯～ 很不甘心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不错嘛 那份倔强。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线电](小鸟)你在犹豫什么啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和Astral一起继续决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们没事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.13,0:15:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们可不是为了拖游马的后腿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才来到这里的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的使命是守护Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你发过誓的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢啊。 绝对要赢下这场决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信他人、珍视朋友与羁绊这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并没有错这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没有错这件事去证明给他们看！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了呢 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助同学去操作管制系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}OK啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.19,0:16:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}委员长负责动力系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}了解。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特酱负责系统环境。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}OK。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)各位，久等了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奉凯特大人之命{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道7，现在参上。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}访问完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安全解除喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}主引擎启动。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}右满舵啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟，大家，加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输出拉满。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从区块E到J出现错误。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能输。绝对不能输…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气冲啊，大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)已脱离危险区域。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了 成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了，大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次轮到游马了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.09,0:17:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对会赢的啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.77,0:17:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是猫猫拳哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.75,0:17:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉。都是因为我才让你们陷入这么危险的境地。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.77,0:17:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)不对，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是凭自己的意志来到这里的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我欠巴利安人情。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你阻止我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是凭自己的意志来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:18:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是你有闲工夫沉浸在无聊的感伤里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.25,0:18:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就赶紧把那家伙揍趴下。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！交给我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.31,0:18:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 我各方面都对不起你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，我们要赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.23,0:18:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，泽阿尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要燃起来了，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我一起……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)来了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来做最后的收尾吧。星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的能和游马合为一体吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.19,0:18:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你现在，是打从心底相信游马吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道不是在怀疑他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对那个曾经对你撒过谎的游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到你自己的内心深处好好地去看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好地看啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)没错 你的心中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.97,0:19:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经产生了一小块黑色的污点了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老老实实承认它吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((黑雾：承认邪恶吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}邪恶……))
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)至今为止一直执拗地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}责备游马的这件事啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.43,0:19:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界！ 那背后 是为了在你的心中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对背叛自己的对象扎下怀疑的根{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让名为愤怒的芽萌发出来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.19,0:19:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)你这家伙纯洁无瑕不知怀疑为何物。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且对遭到背叛没有免疫力。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以只要一点点小小的黑色污渍就足够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅凭那个就是致命伤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 就把那小小的污渍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}扩展到无限绝望的黑暗中去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.99,0:20:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！Astral是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会输给那种东西的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？现在的Astral
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能拒绝黑暗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？Hope Ray V是Barion的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral！Astral！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((黑雾：承认邪恶吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}邪恶…))
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙暴走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Zexal… Zexal… Zexal… Zexal…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral 你怎么了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Zexal！Zexal！Zexal！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.10,0:23:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.39,0:23:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.09,0:23:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.85,0:23:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
